# ── Cleaned data — KEEP for Streamlit Cloud deployment ───────────────────────
# (orders_clean ~15MB, churn_clean ~300KB, flipkart_clean ~50MB)
# Uncomment below to exclude if repo size is a concern:
# data/orders_clean.csv
# data/churn_clean.csv
# data/flipkart_clean.csv

# ── Trained models — large binary files ──────────────────────────────────────
models/*.pkl
models/*.npz
models/*.keras
models/*.h5

# ── Keep model metrics & summaries (small JSON/CSV — always commit) ───────────
!models/churn_metrics.json
!models/lstm_metrics.json
!models/segment_summary.csv
!models/popularity_scores.csv
!models/products_index.csv

# ── Report charts (regenerate by running notebooks) ──────────────────────────
report/*.png
report/*.jpg

# ── Keep the PDF report ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
!report/Smart_Ecommerce_Project_Report.pdf

# ── Dev/utility scripts (not needed for the project itself) ──────────────────
